## Relation to the workspace

PIRTM is L0 in the Tooling layered architecture:

```
L5 Applications
L4 ZK Proof & Verification
L3 Domain Reasoning
L2 Formal Methods
L1 Sigma Kernel
L0 Core Foundations  ← pirtm/ lives here
```

See the [workspace README](../README.md) for the full layer description.
